# SHAPE's VOX SINGS (after VOX 3): for the VOX sound playing, how often it SINGS, its PLACE in the field,
# how far it DRIFTs round it on the tide, and its OCTAVE. Heard on its notes: an octave up, at its place,
# moving as the tide does. SEL twice puts the page back: quiet, in the middle, still, as is.
wait 1000
tap ENV
turn SELECT 5
wait 100
expect page 5
expect vcur 1
turn K1 3
turn K2 -20
turn K3 30
turn K4 1
wait 100
expect sgF01 3
expect sgF11 24
expect sgF21 60
expect sgF31 2
expect set_bpm 90
shot sing_page.png
tap HOME
wait 1000
expect sung <99
wait 40000
expect sung 1
wait 2000
tapkey w1
wait 100
tapkey w1
wait 6000
expect span <99
tap ENV
turn SELECT -10
turn SELECT 5
wait 100
expect page 5
tap SEL
wait 100
tap SEL
wait 100
expect sgF01 0
expect sgF11 64
expect sgF21 0
expect sgF31 1
expect clips 0
